        "text": "The Supreme Court held that the unnecessary\u2011restraint and predischarge\u2011notice provisions of the Federal Nursing Home Reform Act (FNHRA) create rights that are enforceable under 42\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f1983."
      },
