          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, states are entitled to clear notice that they will be subject to private lawsuits if they accept Spending Clause money, a rule that aligns with federalism and separation\u2011of\u2011powers principles and the common\u2011law treatment of third\u2011party beneficiary claims at the time \u00a7\u202f1983 was enacted."
        }
